# What stays out of git, and why

Policy: KiCad sources, shared libraries, manufacturing data and CAD sources are
tracked. Order packages, heavy 3D exports and reference material are not.

## OS / editor debris

Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## KiCad per-machine state

These change on every pan, zoom or save and carry no design information.

*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache
_autosave-*
*-backups/
.history*

## Local-only material, kept on disk but deliberately not published

datasheets/
private/

## Reference output that is regenerated, not authored

manufacturing/**/*.zip
manufacturing/gerbers/
manufacturing/jlcpcb/
manufacturing/production/

## Heavy 3D: regenerable from the PCB or published as release assets

*.blend
*.blend1
*.pcb3d
*.FCBak
*.stl
mechanical/*-cut.step
